Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Sejf nowy: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault szyfruj: message klucz: key.
>> decrypted := vault odszyfruj: encrypted klucz: key.

Wyjście 
pisz: ['Message:'], nowa-linia
pisz: message, nowa-linia
pisz: ['Decrypted:'], nowa-linia
pisz: decrypted, nowa-linia.
